# BizInvestify Mobile Implementation Rules

## Overview
This document defines binding standards and best practices for implementing features in the BizInvestify mobile application. These rules ensure consistent UX, accessibility, maintainability, and performance across the app. Follow them unless an explicit, documented exception is approved in a PR.

